### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finora Admin",
  "email": "admin@finora.test",
  "password": "Finora123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@finora.test",
  "password": "Finora123"
}

### Create Customer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Aarav Mehta",
  "phone": "",
  "address": "Shop 12, Main Road, Mumbai",
  "aadhaarNumber": "",
  "panNumber": ""
}

### Create Loan
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customer": "{{customerId}}",
  "principal": 4200000,
  "monthlyInterestRate": 2.5,
  "interestType": "simple",
  "startDate": "2026-05-15",
  "dueDate": "2026-06-15"
}
